# As of 2026-11-07 limitations

Missing live access / supplier credit / financing is an **external dependency**, not proof of defective software or unprofitable deals. Do not fabricate live-access results. Do not hammer unavailable systems without a real access change. Keep access-dependent steps resume-ready.